        "math_academy_id": "q-76641",
        "problem": "Find the exact value of $2\\operatorname{sin}\u2061({75}^{\u2218})\\operatorname{cos}\u2061({75}^{\u2218}).$",
        "worked_solution": "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for sine: \n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}\u2061x\\operatorname{cos}\u2061x=\\operatorname{sin}\u20612x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={75}^{\u2218}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}\u2061({75}^{\u2218})\\operatorname{cos}\u2061({75}^{\u2218}) & =\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(2\\cdot {75}^{\u2218}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}\u2061{150}^{\u2218} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}\u2061({75}^{\u2218})\\operatorname{cos}\u2061({75}^{\u2218})=\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$",
